  "caption": "Stress-test outcomes and matched OOF-relative changes: protocol-level evidence, not final-model.",
  "reading_guide": "Rows are protocols and columns are route-specific metrics. Large cell labels are the original stored values; small labels and the blue-white-amber colour encode 100*(stress/reference-1), with zero at the same route's AB-blocked OOF reference. References are R-log RMSE=4.904836, R-log EF=60.486349 and S-eps EF=62.223405. Signed colour indicates raw change, not a universal better/worse direction: lower RMSE and higher EF are desirable. No estimates are refitted. Valid EF evaluations are 5/5, 3/3 and 29/35; zero-positive cases remain undefined. Total budgets are 100,60,700 and defined-EF budgets 100,60,580. Populations, prevalences and budgets differ, so cross-protocol colours cannot rank extrapolation difficulty. These are R-log/S-eps protocol-level evidence, not final-model H-soft validation.",
